# Form 909-WARP — repository hygiene
#
# The project itself has no build output. This file exists to keep the working
# tree clean when contributors run local tooling, and to prevent the rendered
# WAV bounces the app produces from ever being committed.

# ── Rendered audio (the app downloads these to the user's machine) ──────────
*.wav
*.aiff
*.flac
BUREAU_UNREASONABLE_*

# ── Node ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

# ── Local environment ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Caches / coverage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
coverage/
*.log
